+  - Line 1: N M            (paths go from (0,0) to (N,M) using unit right/down steps)
+  - Line 2: r1 c1 r2 c2    (hole = lattice points with r1 <= r <= r2 and c1 <= c <= c2;
+                            paths may not visit any of them)
+  - If line 2 is missing or the rectangle is empty (r1 > r2 or c1 > c2), no hole.
+  - Output: the number of valid paths modulo 1e9+7.
 """
 import sys
 
